        <mxCell id="hejjuVNxbMeRw50ZfaC6-359" parent="hejjuVNxbMeRw50ZfaC6-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;APIC Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Going forward any APIs published by apps in NG LZ will go wither AWS Intra or Extra APICs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Publishing unauthenticated APIs in AWS public APIC requires derogation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apps in NG LZ continue to consume APIs of other apps via EMEA Intra or On-Prem Private APICs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Technically APIs in AAI/ANAI/EMEA Extra/EMEA Public are accessible for apps in NG LZ for consumption, but should first try to see if the API is available in Private/Intra APICs or if they can be published there.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="740" x="660" y="-1300" as="geometry" />
